<title>EGYPT: Egypt offers 91-day T-bills worth 900 million.</title>
<headline>Egypt offers 91-day T-bills worth 900 million.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 91-day treasury bills worth 900 million pounds for auction on January 22 and issue on January 24 when 91-day bills worth 984.525 million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 9.984 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.40 pounds</p>
</text>
